WEBVTT

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:13.690
Ah, work’s done.

00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:16.450
I feel like we did a good job today!

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:21.410
Bu-Ling has a day off tomorrow.

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:23.910
Oh yes!

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:27.460
Tomorrow I have some important business.

00:00:34.460 --> 00:00:37.840
We’re still searching for the Mew Aqua, but...

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:39.270
Nothing new?

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:41.640
Hurry up.

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:42.480
Yes.

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:48.890
Oh well. I’m out for a bit.

00:00:48.890 --> 00:00:49.980
Tart!

00:00:50.810 --> 00:00:52.440
Where are you going?

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:54.070
I’m just going for a walk.

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:56.450
Wait!

00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:04.370
Damn!

00:01:04.990 --> 00:01:05.250
Yo!

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:18.840
It seems your wound has pretty much healed
but there’s no point pushing yourself.

00:01:18.840 --> 00:01:20.050
This wound...

00:01:20.050 --> 00:01:25.560
You’ll be back on your feet and busy again
soon, so just rest your body for now.

00:01:26.470 --> 00:01:29.980
Make sure you don’t ruin our hard work again.

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:32.860
Yes...

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:35.020
This is a present for you.

00:01:35.020 --> 00:01:38.820
When humans are hurt, friends bring them
fruit as symbols of their affection.

00:01:40.490 --> 00:01:44.160
Don’t be down. Pie is actually the
one who told me to bring these.

00:01:44.740 --> 00:01:47.540
Ok now, we’ll be going.

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:50.670
We’ve thought of a new plan.

00:01:59.090 --> 00:02:00.430
Wake up.

00:02:02.050 --> 00:02:03.310
Wake up.

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:05.480
Wake up.

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:09.690
Where am I?

00:02:10.430 --> 00:02:11.820
Wake up...

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:20.740
That dream again...
Just what does it mean?

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:23.700
Dream?

00:02:24.070 --> 00:02:26.820
Yes, lately I’ve been having this recurring dream.

00:02:26.820 --> 00:02:28.660
What’s the dream about?

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:31.960
I don’t remember too well, but...

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:36.260
Someone tells me to wake up;
I wake up in my dream but...

00:02:37.540 --> 00:02:39.590
he keeps telling me: “Wake up!”

00:02:39.590 --> 00:02:40.680
What a weird dream.

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:42.930
Oh, I see.

00:02:43.380 --> 00:02:46.270
Well they’re different to yours, but
I have lots of weird dreams too!

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:47.730
Lots of?

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:50.730
Like in one dream I’m chasing dried bonito...

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:54.480
...or peeling a bamboo shoot endlessly.

00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:57.940
In another dream, my know-it-all attitude
ended up as  international problem.

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:05.620
How embarrassing!

00:03:07.430 --> 00:03:08.040
Thanks.

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:12.340
You cheered me up.

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:16.710
I don’t know how I cheered you up,
but being happy’s the best!

00:03:17.120 --> 00:03:18.170
Yup.

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:23.760
What’s wrong?

00:03:24.670 --> 00:03:27.210
I’m just thinking about the long afternoon full of classes...

00:03:27.210 --> 00:03:29.140
There go my feelings of happiness.

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:30.850
Hang in there!

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:31.980
Come on, we’ll be late.

00:03:32.430 --> 00:03:33.310
Ok.

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:53.700
It’s that time of year again. The live event
with the best street performers!

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:56.500
And fifty thousand people are watching!

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:00.460
The show’s starting...

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:02.970
Spectators cheering!

00:04:03.750 --> 00:04:07.430
And at the very moment their excitement
reaches a climax...

00:04:07.840 --> 00:04:09.820
“Bu-Ling-chan Kick!”

00:04:10.890 --> 00:04:13.850
My show will start no matter what anyone says!

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:17.360
Yes, here come the doves!

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:22.070
Bu-Ling! Bu-Ling! Bu-Ling!

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:25.530
They’re throwing me tons of ohineri!

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:32.500
Fifty thousand people will be throwing me money. Just thinking about it is so dreamy!

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:41.670
I’m burning with passion!

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:45.260
Okay, it’s time to go!

00:04:47.670 --> 00:04:48.720
An earthquake?

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:54.020
That’s...?!

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:22.920
Mew Mew Pudding METAMORPHOS-SE!

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:10.380
What’s this place?

00:06:10.380 --> 00:06:12.100
What the...? You’re here already?

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:14.720
Tart!

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:15.640
Yo!

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:17.850
What are you doing at a place like this,

00:06:18.430 --> 00:06:20.940
digging this huge hole?

00:06:21.350 --> 00:06:22.400
It’s an experiment.

00:06:23.390 --> 00:06:26.400
We’re going to let the dome above fall down.

00:06:27.060 --> 00:06:34.370
This is a small test. If it works then we’ll
have the whole Tokyo area cave in.

00:06:36.030 --> 00:06:37.120
Oh no!

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:42.840
Doing something like that is dangerous!

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:46.210
Duh! That’s why we’re doing it!

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:48.540
This is why I hate kids...

00:06:48.540 --> 00:06:51.390
Wow, I’m a little bit taller!

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:52.720
Shut up!

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:55.930
Anyway, that’s what’s going to happen if we keep digging.

00:07:00.680 --> 00:07:02.480
Now you’re scared, right?

00:07:02.980 --> 00:07:04.940
I won’t let you do things like that!

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:08.190
Very well. Stop me, if you can.

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:13.870
A Chimera Anima!

00:07:14.450 --> 00:07:16.620
Today I’m going to make you cry!

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:19.290
Go, Chimera Anima!

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:33.680
What’s wrong? You won’t defeat it by running away!

00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:34.970
I...

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:36.140
...know that!

00:07:38.260 --> 00:07:39.350
PuddingRings!

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:49.780
Reborn PuddingRings Inferno!

00:08:00.030 --> 00:08:01.910
Another one?!

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:02.880
Oh!

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:05.340
Too slow!

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:08.880
I won’t let you run.
What do you think of this?!

00:08:14.210 --> 00:08:17.510
Did you forget that I can manipulate plants?

00:08:17.510 --> 00:08:19.640
Now, do it!

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:36.820
This is bad!

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:38.610
I can’t control it anymore.

00:08:38.610 --> 00:08:42.380
Haha! That’s so lame!

00:08:42.380 --> 00:08:43.830
Shut up!

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:08.020
New Year’s Street Performance Live Show?

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:11.850
It must be an awesome show if
Bu-Ling-san wants to watch it.

00:09:11.850 --> 00:09:14.150
Everyone, that dome is our next job.

00:09:14.150 --> 00:09:14.700
Shirogane?

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:16.410
Did something happen?

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:19.040
We’ve received the signal of a Chimera Anima!

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:21.410
Hurry up and head over there!

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:34.380
Hey, what are you doing, being buried?

00:09:46.010 --> 00:09:50.730
The exit’s blocked. It serves you right!

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:53.610
Thank you!

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:57.900
Thanks for helping me out.

00:09:57.900 --> 00:09:59.440
Wait a second.

00:09:59.440 --> 00:10:00.360
Here.

00:10:00.360 --> 00:10:01.080
What’s this?

00:10:01.360 --> 00:10:03.540
That’s a present for saving me.

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:04.700
For me?

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:05.620
Sure!

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:12.120
Stop fooling around!

00:10:12.120 --> 00:10:14.330
Why should I have that?

00:10:14.330 --> 00:10:16.130
Listen, Tart...

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:18.760
You don’t have to act like a bad guy.

00:10:19.460 --> 00:10:22.600
You know, we can’t fight in here anyway.

00:10:24.220 --> 00:10:28.730
*I* can get out of here easily by teleportation!

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:30.310
You’re the one who’s in trouble here!

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:40.780
Where’s the Chimera Anima?

00:10:42.360 --> 00:10:43.410
Everyone?

00:10:44.070 --> 00:10:44.790
What?

00:10:48.740 --> 00:10:49.580
That’s...

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:50.880
The Chimera Anima?

00:10:51.230 --> 00:10:54.080
So today’s Chimera Anima is a catfish?

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:55.090
Oh my god!

00:10:59.030 --> 00:10:59.550
It’s coming!

00:11:03.510 --> 00:11:04.470
Here you come!

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:06.590
But I can’t see the Aliens.

00:11:06.590 --> 00:11:08.350
It might be a plot.

00:11:08.350 --> 00:11:09.400
Take care!

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:14.230
Anyway, let’s go!

00:11:15.350 --> 00:11:18.820
Mew Mew Strawberry METAMORPHO-SE!

00:11:27.570 --> 00:11:30.880
Mew Mew Mint METAMORPHO-SE!

00:11:38.250 --> 00:11:41.430
Mew Mew Lettuce METAMORPHO-SE!

00:11:46.300 --> 00:11:49.230
Mew Mew Pomegranate METAMORPHO-SE!

00:11:58.580 --> 00:12:04.530
Listen. The exit’s been blocked, which
means you can’t get out of here.

00:12:05.070 --> 00:12:06.700
You’ll die here!

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:08.910
Someone will come and save us.

00:12:08.910 --> 00:12:10.120
Forget it...

00:12:10.870 --> 00:12:14.050
Since the Chimera Anima is now digging uncontrollably,

00:12:14.050 --> 00:12:17.300
the dome will soon collapse and you’ll be as flat as a pancake.

00:12:18.580 --> 00:12:20.550
So. Are you scared now?

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:24.640
What’s so funny?

00:12:25.550 --> 00:12:28.510
In that case, we will turn into fossils, together.

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:33.440
Like I said, *I* can get out of here easily.

00:12:33.970 --> 00:12:37.690
So... let’s hold hands.

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:38.940
Why?! What are you up to?!

00:12:38.940 --> 00:12:40.730
I think if were going to become fossils,

00:12:40.730 --> 00:12:44.240
it’d be more fun to be smiling and holding hands.

00:12:45.990 --> 00:12:47.820
You’re so weird.

00:12:50.030 --> 00:12:52.920
Reborn Strawberry Surprise!

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:05.600
Reborn Lettuce Rush!

00:13:08.510 --> 00:13:09.430
Thank you, Minto!

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:11.300
Don’t let your guard down!

00:13:11.300 --> 00:13:12.850
Let’s go, everyone!

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:16.270
Reborn Pomegran’ Spear!

00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:19.900
Minto!

00:13:20.140 --> 00:13:21.190
Oneesama!

00:13:24.900 --> 00:13:27.200
Mew Lettuce, don’t let it go into the earth.

00:13:27.650 --> 00:13:29.950
Reborn Lettuce Rush!

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:34.500
Now! Mew Strawberry!

00:13:51.430 --> 00:13:54.350
Reborn Strawberry Surprise!

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:02.810
Yay!

00:14:02.810 --> 00:14:03.780
Everyone!

00:14:04.860 --> 00:14:06.650
It’s too early to celebrate!

00:14:07.900 --> 00:14:09.110
What do you mean?

00:14:10.360 --> 00:14:14.320
This Chimera Anima has been digging
around under the Dome.

00:14:14.320 --> 00:14:17.830
We’ve detected a huge cave underneath the dome.

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:22.460
At this rate...
the whole dome will collapse!

00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:31.760
Hey, what should we do, Shirogane?!

00:14:31.760 --> 00:14:34.800
The first thing we should do is evacuate
the people in the dome.

00:14:34.800 --> 00:14:36.810
Bu-Ling must be among them!

00:14:37.260 --> 00:14:39.980
Before that there’s something you have to do.

00:14:40.390 --> 00:14:41.890
What is it?

00:14:41.890 --> 00:14:44.320
There are as many as fifty thousand people in the dome.

00:14:45.020 --> 00:14:48.650
If that many people rush out in a panic
the ground will cave in!

00:14:49.150 --> 00:14:50.780
So what should we do?

00:14:51.070 --> 00:14:53.860
You guys must support the dome.

00:14:53.860 --> 00:14:57.170
In the meantime, we’ll try to evacuate everyone.

00:14:57.780 --> 00:15:00.960
Please hold it until we’ve got everyone out of there.

00:15:02.120 --> 00:15:05.290
That’s not a job for girls...

00:15:05.290 --> 00:15:06.960
How much does it weight? Like 10 tons?

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:10.430
I can lift 100 kilograms or so, but...

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:16.680
Hey, why aren’t you scared?

00:15:17.600 --> 00:15:19.600
Why!? Answ...!

00:15:23.570 --> 00:15:24.380
You...

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:27.780
Right. There’s hardly any oxygen left.

00:15:28.270 --> 00:15:29.820
Hey, are you ok?

00:15:31.480 --> 00:15:33.120
What am I doing?

00:15:33.690 --> 00:15:35.410
She’s my enemy!

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:41.040
Damn.

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:47.380
Surround the dome.
Release your Mew Power!

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:50.930
We’re missing Bu-Ling, but now is
not the time to complain about it.

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:55.050
Go for it! The lives of fifty thousand
people are in your hands!

00:15:55.630 --> 00:15:57.100
Support the dome at all costs!

00:15:58.140 --> 00:15:59.270
Ready, everyone?

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:00.480
Yes!

00:16:01.740 --> 00:16:03.980
Mew Power Extension!

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:06.940
The power has been released!

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:27.840
Emergency. Emergency.

00:16:31.170 --> 00:16:32.970
Hurry and leave the building now!

00:16:33.550 --> 00:16:37.470
Follow the guards’ instructions and leave here right now.

00:16:38.380 --> 00:16:41.270
The danger is imminent.
Please leave here right away.

00:16:41.800 --> 00:16:42.850
What?

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:05.960
Please! Don’t collapse!

00:17:05.960 --> 00:17:08.550
Being human is pretty inconvenient, isn’t it?

00:17:10.120 --> 00:17:10.920
Hey.

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:16.350
Tell me you’re scared already!

00:17:18.410 --> 00:17:19.840
I'm not.

00:17:19.840 --> 00:17:20.970
Wha?

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:23.900
I’m not alone.

00:17:24.350 --> 00:17:26.560
My friend is beside me.

00:17:27.060 --> 00:17:27.900
Friend??

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:32.360
Yup. Me and Taru-taru, we’re friends.

00:17:33.110 --> 00:17:34.520
Stop kidding me!

00:17:34.520 --> 00:17:36.950
We’re not friends!

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:51.340
Really, how long must we keep this up?

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:55.180
Don’t give up!

00:18:17.490 --> 00:18:20.950
Me and Taru-taru, we’re friends.

00:18:22.610 --> 00:18:26.120
Argh, it’d be boring if you died.

00:18:40.260 --> 00:18:41.640
That’s my limit!

00:18:42.930 --> 00:18:44.140
Is it time to give up?

00:18:57.690 --> 00:18:59.360
What? What’s going on?

00:19:14.120 --> 00:19:14.880
That...

00:19:14.880 --> 00:19:18.840
The Plants suddenly grew and supported the Dome.

00:19:18.840 --> 00:19:20.420
Mew Strawberry!

00:19:20.420 --> 00:19:22.170
What does it mean?

00:19:22.170 --> 00:19:23.850
What are all those plants doing there?

00:19:30.180 --> 00:19:32.270
Hey, how much longer are you going to sleep?

00:19:34.640 --> 00:19:35.650
Taru-taru!

00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:38.700
Stop calling me that!

00:19:41.780 --> 00:19:42.830
Those are...?

00:19:44.110 --> 00:19:46.950
So you saved my life, Taru-taru?

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:49.500
I told you to stop calling me that!

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:51.960
Thank you, Taru-taru!

00:19:53.120 --> 00:19:55.090
You’re a friend!!

00:19:55.090 --> 00:19:58.920
My friend, friend, friend!

00:19:58.920 --> 00:19:59.840
Stop!

00:20:00.600 --> 00:20:05.890
Listen. I only saved your life because
I haven’t seen you crying yet!

00:20:24.760 --> 00:20:27.930
Where does happiness come from?

00:20:27.930 --> 00:20:31.810
I guess mine comes from Aoyama-kun!

00:20:31.810 --> 00:20:32.520
Uhm...

00:20:32.520 --> 00:20:34.100
Enough Aoyama-kun!

00:20:34.100 --> 00:20:36.190
It’s easy to be happy when you’re stupid!

00:20:36.190 --> 00:20:37.540
Ah, that’s not what I meant.

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:40.070
Minto, who would that be in your case?

00:20:40.070 --> 00:20:41.270
What I meant by “happiness” is–

00:20:41.270 --> 00:20:45.360
What I call happiness is something
that comes out from inside me.

00:20:45.360 --> 00:20:49.280
Next time: “The Wind Brings Happiness, a Heartfelt Prayer”.

00:20:49.280 --> 00:20:52.370
I’d like to know how you can be so confident!

00:20:52.370 --> 00:20:53.990
Hello? Do you ever listen to me?
